arXiv:2611.15176v1 Announce Type: new 
Abstract: Let \(0<p><\infty\). We prove \[
  L_q(0,1)\hookrightarrow\mathcal C_{p,q}
  \quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad q=2. \] As a consequence, we obtain, for all \(0<\infty\), \[
  L_{p_1,q_1}(0,1)\hookrightarrow\mathcal C_{p_2,q_2}
  \quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad p_1=q_1=2. \]
